    <briefdescription>
<para>Time-Range Filter for querying edges valid during a time window. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Checks if edge has ANY overlap with the query time range [range_start, range_end]. Edge is included if: edge.valid_from &lt;= range_end AND edge.valid_to &gt;= range_start </para>
    </detaileddescription>
